{"id":"n85911-2-8","stage":2,"title":"피하다 · 忌讳","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85911-2-8-1","ko":"회의는 언제 할까?","zh":"会议打算什么时候开？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"회의는","meaning":"会，会议","explanation":"회의：会，会议；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"회의","audio":"/audio/8ada2d6d6aa420fc4f0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73244","senseId":"1","lemma":"회의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회의는","audio":"/audio/9596146b35e6ada4712f.mp3"}},{"text":"언제","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}},{"text":"할까?","meaning":"要举行、进行吗（会议）","explanation":"하다：做、进行；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할까","audio":"/audio/8f972208798a5637049f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8ada2d6d6aa420fc","term":"회의","zh":"会，会议","audio":"/audio/8ada2d6d6aa420fc4f0d.mp3","entryId":"73244","definition":"许多人聚在一起讨论；或指这种聚会。","pronunciation":["회ː의","훼ː이"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不明确指定的未来某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做、进行","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做、进行","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/217f08435e92097bda5e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85911-2-8-2","ko":"주말에는 사람들이 쉬니까 주말을 피해서 정하자.","zh":"周末大家都在休息，咱们避开周末再定时间吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주말에는","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주말에는","audio":"/audio/0b27d6d47879bf3eaa83.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들이","audio":"/audio/42e5b243df0b3ed051af.mp3"}},{"text":"쉬니까","meaning":"休息，歇","explanation":"쉬다：休息，歇；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71280","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쉬니까","audio":"/audio/3e0d2b7cc16d8d3b93fa.mp3"}},{"text":"주말을","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주말을","audio":"/audio/1a9fd874d307def97463.mp3"}},{"text":"피해서","meaning":"避开、不选这一天（安排日期）","explanation":"피하다：避开不合适的日子；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"피하다","audio":"/audio/5b302c912e92db47d228.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85911","senseId":"2","lemma":"피하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"피해서","audio":"/audio/e1decf9d6b31b9f2f3d3.mp3"}},{"text":"정하자.","meaning":"定，选定","explanation":"정하다：定，选定；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"정하다","audio":"/audio/2b712f8bfe2006ebd91d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29767","senseId":"1","lemma":"정하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정하자","audio":"/audio/8c81125ec4eee275c091.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b